<title>DUBAI: Caltex raises Bahrain gas oil, jet prices.</title>
<headline>Caltex raises Bahrain gas oil, jet prices.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Caltex said it has raised posted prices for gas oil ex-Bahrain to 83 cents a gallon for 0.5 percent sulphur from 81 cents and to 82 cents a gallon for the one percent grade from 80 cents.</p>
<p>Jet A-1 fuel and dual purpose kerosene went up to 88 cents a gallon each from 85 cents a gallon.</p>
<p>Heavy fuel oil (380 cst) was up to $18.88 a barrel from $18.38. The company said the prices took effect on December 5.</p>
</text>
